  "use_case": "Use this preschool registration time-ordered tracking when staff must document class placement and start readiness. Reconcile daily routine, support route, authorized pickup, and family orientation before the preschool registration handoff. Use the application, age or placement source, classroom availability, readiness list, daily-routine sheet, pickup authorization, orientation receipt, and start confirmation. Ask the assigned preschool registration reviewer to confirm class placement against the organization's policy.",
